# A Luxel library scene (Gitea #785) — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# The layer FPS override (the wire's `A` line): the spinner record plays at 12,
# this layer runs it at 8 so it matches the bouncing caption.
S - Loading
U 32 32
L color 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Backdrop
K 07090f
L sprite 12 8 7 7 normal 100 none fill 1
N Spinner
I @spr/spinner
A 8
L text 0 19 0 0 normal 100 black fill 1
N Message
T lit LOADING
F tiny 9db8ff c bounce 8
